            0.114,
            0.502,
            0.81,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ You may share any bills you have at home with the class. Observe the different elements present in the bills. Are there any similarities or differences in these bills?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
